XigmaNAS® 14.4.0.5 - Ingsley
----------------------------
Changes:
- Upgrade underlying OS to 14.4-RELEASE P5.
- Upgrade bash to v5.3p12.
- Upgrade dmidecode to v3.7.
- Upgrade e2fsprogs to v1.47.4.
- Upgrade iperf3 to v3.21.
- Upgrade open-vm-tools to v13.0.10.
- Upgrade virtualbox-ose to 7.2.8.
- Upgrade phpvirtualbox to 7.2-3.
- Upgrade microcode amd to v20251202.
- Upgrade microcode intel to v20260512.
- Upgrade nano to v9.0.
- Upgrade netatalk to v4.4.3.
- Upgrade nut to v2026.05.25.
- Upgrade pecl-APCu to v5.1.28.
- Upgrade php8 to v8.4.22.
- Upgrade proftpd to v1.3.9b.
- Upgrade rsync to v3.4.4.
- Upgrade zoneinfo to v2026b.
